## The loop

1. Fix the revision and read callers ([01]({{ref_01}})).
2. Cold pass through the seven dimensions; write candidates ([01]({{ref_01}})).
3. Try to disprove each one; keep only those with a given/when/then scenario ([02]({{ref_02}})).
4. Rank, cap and report ([03]({{ref_03}})); apply the verdict rules ([04]({{ref_04}})).

